WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
SPEAKER 1: I am passionate
about machine learning,

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.590
but how do I show
that to the world?

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.210
SPEAKER 2: Have you considered
the Google Cloud Professional

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.210
ML Engineer certification?

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.360
It's basically a professional
stamp of approval.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.470
Plus, preparing for it will
solidify your understanding

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:20.910
of designing, building, and
productizing your machine

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.720
learning models to solve
business challenges using

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.670
the Google Cloud ML tools.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.470
SPEAKER 1: Tell me
more about this exam.

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:32.070
SPEAKER 2: It's a two-hour
multiple choice exam,

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.250
and you can take in a
dedicated testing center

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.828
or from a remote location
via online proctoring.

00:00:38.828 --> 00:00:39.870
SPEAKER 1: This is great.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:40.590
Thanks.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.965
Any advice on where do I start?

00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:43.590
SPEAKER 2: Yep.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:45.750
There are tons of
training resources,

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.060
from sample questions
to hands-on labs

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.800
and on-demand courses.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.335
Just check them out.

00:00:51.335 --> 00:00:51.960
SPEAKER 1: Wow.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:52.770
Even better.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.460
Let me get started right away.

